  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這個模組為JEI添加了附魔資訊條目。當你將滑鼠游標懸停在帶有單一附魔的書上時，按下R鍵即可查看其相關資訊。<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>模組作者</strong></span>：如需為您的模組添加附魔的語言檔案描述條目，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Phylogeny/JEIEnchantmentInfo#readme\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Readme</a>中的說明。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">錯誤回報、功能請求、問題諮詢等均可透過<a href=\"https://github.com/Phylogeny/JEIEnchantmentInfo/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub問題追蹤器</a>提交。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組已釋出至公有領域，您可以在任何地方以任何形式使用它。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei-enchantment-info/pages/changelogs\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日誌</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>附魔資訊</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/1RbjMBRv/Enchantment-Info.gif\" alt=\"附魔資訊展示\" width=\"396\" height=\"386\"></span></p>",
